; HCWBRIDGEIMPORT reads docs/bridge/fixtures/levels-only.json: it lists the changes, does nothing on No, adds the floors and project details on Yes, and a
; second run finds nothing to change. HCWLEVELS then lists the two floors with the heights from the file.
; PREPARE: docs/bridge/fixtures/levels-only.json => levels-only.json
; EXPECT: Bridge file levels-only\.json
; EXPECT: New floor Ground
; EXPECT: New floor First
; EXPECT: HCWBRIDGEIMPORT: nothing was changed
; EXPECT: HCWBRIDGEIMPORT: applied \d+ change\(s\)
; EXPECT: Ground: FFL \+0\.000, floor to floor 3150, ceiling 3000, lintel bottom 2100, slab 150 mm
; EXPECT: First: FFL \+3\.150, floor to floor 3150
; EXPECT: the drawing already has these values
; REJECT: refused|not valid JSON
HCWBRIDGEIMPORT
{WORK}\levels-only.json
N
HCWBRIDGEIMPORT
{WORK}\levels-only.json
Y
HCWLEVELS
HCWBRIDGEIMPORT
{WORK}\levels-only.json
